; pos=fail warn=1 error=1
; *declination auto must report a coordinate system PROJ can't build a
; transform from rather than crash.
*cs out EPSG:32616
*cs custom "+proj=pipeline +step +proj=unitconvert +xy_in=m +xy_out=m"
*declination auto 500000 4000000 100
*date 2000.01.01
*data normal from to tape compass clino
a b 10 0 0
